# Visions  |  Structure

Player awakenes in a dark room

1:
Branch A: Player checks pockets
Branch A1: Player checks desk, sees note to check pockets
Branch B: Player tries to open door

2:
Branch A: Player finds the glasses, puts them on and sees writing on the wall
Branch B: Door is locked, put ear to door or check desk

3:
Branch A: Player checks under desk and finds key and drill
Branch B1: Player hears ticking behind the door
Branch B2: Player checks desk, sees note to check pockets

4:
Branch A: Player unlocks door, walks out and is spotted by the alarm system
Branch B1: Glasses fall out of pocket, puts them on and sees writing on the wall
Branch B2: Player (while crouching at the bottom of the door) spots the key under the desk

5:
Branch B1: Player checks under desk and finds key and drill, player drills the marked spot on the wall and severs a bundle of wires, disabling the alarm system.
Branch B2: Player grabs the key and unlocks the door, walks out and is spotted by alarm system
Branch B3: Player grabs the drill

6:
Branch B1: Player walks out of the door and sees a guard in the distance, there is a door to the left and a door to the right
Branch B3: Player hears a knock on the door and a robotic voice asking what they're doing

7:
Branch B1: Player checks the left door, it's locked and the guard spots them. Begins approaching
Branch B2: Player checks the right door, enters and sees another empty room
Branch C1: Player uses the drill to disable the guard robot
Branch C2: Player is apprehended by guard robot
Branch C3: Player tries to persuade the guard robot

8:
Branch B1: Player tries to persuade the guard robot
Branch B2: Player uses glasses and sees message on wall, Opens escape hatch
Branch B3: Player continues down hall
Branch C1: Player leaves the room and sees the two doors
Branch C2: Player lose
Branch C3: Player asks the robot a paradox, disabling it

9:
Branch B1: Player lose
Branch B2: Player win!
Branch B3: Lights go out, player lose
Branch C1: Player chooses left door, enters and finds the guards supply room. Picks up flashlight and radio
Branch C2: Player chooses right door, sees blank room
Branch C3: Player exits room

